s where it starts to  get very  very interesting with a few different  details  first of all if you look at that camera  bump it looks essentially  identical to the one that's on the  macbook air  and on top of that we have that mic  right next to it on the side whereas on  the air  it's below it so it looks like it's  getting the same exact specs in terms of  the rear cameras  but the absolutely crazy thing from this  render is that apparently the ipad mini  6 is getting  the smart connector which it has never  had  before and this is really weird because  the ipad mini has  never had the smart connector on the  back and that's because the mini is so  small that it can't really support  regular keyboard cases even the one on  the 11 inch ipad pro  is scrunched down compared to the full  size 12.9 inch model so  i don't know how apple is gonna pull off  a keyboard case on mini  unless this is for something else so i  don't know it's going to be very  interesting  one random thought that i'm having is  that what if apple is going to use that  smart connector  for charging and maybe what if that  smart connector  makes it on the back of the next iphone  to use with a brand new charger that  kind of just tacks onto the back  that also supports all of the ipad pros  because i don't know if you know this or  not  but the magic keyboard case supports  full speed charging  through the smart connector with that  new hinge but anyway  moving on to this next image we can see  that the mini is getting basically the  same edge to edge display  with the rounded corners the same as on  the  air but the interesting detail to notice  is that the bezels  are definitely slimmer on the mini which  is nice  and it totally makes sense because if  they were the same size the display  would look really weird especially for  that small of a size and this actually  makes me think that the next ipad  air is gonna have the same slim bezels  as the mini  because i don't know if you know this  but back in 2019  the 10.5 inch ipad air 3 received the  same  thin bezels on the sides matching the  ones on the mini and as for this new  mini 6  you should expect the display to remain  basically the same  probably including the same resolution  since the pixels per inch on the current  mini  is already much higher than their 264  pixels per inch goal for their ipad  displays  now moving on according to john prosser  he says that the ipad mini 6's new  dimensions  are going to be three millimeters longer  and three millimeters  wider while keeping the thickness  exactly the same so this is essentially  going to allow the display to get much  larger  which mecha thinks is going to be around  8.5  to 9 inches on the new mini and moving  on as expected  touch id is being built into the power  button  just like it is on the ipad air 4 and  because of the smaller size of the mini  it's probably going to be easier to use  compared to the air but in my opinion  face id on the ipad pro is much much  better  but of course apple's going to be  keeping that as an exclusive feature  just for the pros and here is the weird  part there are no speaker grills on the  top  of the ipad mini 6 like there are on the  ipad ear 4. so we asked john about this  on twitter and he confirmed  that the speakers will only be on the  bottom  which is very frustrating because we  know that it's not getting  full stereo sound when you hold it in  landscape mode but nevertheless  jon says that his sources say that the  speakers are  crazy nice even if they're only gonna be  on the bottom  which sounds a bit weird to me but i  guess in reality  since the ipad mini is so small there's  probably a limited amount of space on  the inside  for those extra speakers now moving on  to the next image we have the bottom  which shows those speaker grilles  and apparently a new usb-c port which is  awesome and it totally makes sense  because  when apple redesigned the ipad air 4  they gave it usbc  so it makes sense for the ipad mini as  well and that's going to give you access  to a bunch of docs  adapters and of course it's a much  better porn and this  right here is very interesting john's  sources say that the ipad mini 6 is  going to be coming in silver  gold and black not space gray  but black so that's going to be  interesting to see and right here we can  see the apple pencil support which the  mini has  but one interesting detail he says is  that there was an apple pencil 3  leak a few months ago but he compared  that leaked image to the size of the  current apple pencil  and he's showing that the new apple  pencil is  a little bit shorter and that actually  makes total sense for the mini  because if you think about it the  current apple pencil 2  is almost the same length of the current  ipad  mini which is very funny so a shorter  apple pencil makes total sense  but then going even further john thinks  that this might actually be  the new apple pencil 3 that's meant for  all of the ipads  and if you think about it the current  apple pencil does  seem unnecessarily long so making it a  bit shorter  wouldn't be that big of a deal and on  top of that it's going to make it much  easier for younger kids and students to  use compared to the current apple pencil  but based on all of those leaked details  and the renders made by ian zelbo  we can actually do some extra analysis  to figure out some more details like the  potential release date  the price and some more of the specs so  since the new mini 6 seems to be  essentially a smaller version of the  ipad air 4  right down to the camera bump the design  and of course the display we can almost  certainly expect  a lot of the specs to match up and we  know that because in 2019  the ipad air 3 and the ipad mini 4 were  essentially  identical in terms of the specs and  features apart from the smart connector  so if we look at the specs of the latest  ipad air 4 we should expect the new mini  to get 64 gigs of storage at the base  price  the same touch id power button the same  20 watt usbc power adapter  all of the same display features the  same 12 megapixel camera on the back  the same 7 megapixel camera on the front  and the same wi-fi 6 support with  bluetooth 5.0  but according to john he says that it's  going to be coming with 5g  cellular support which isn't currently  on the air 4  so that means that apple might actually  update some of the other specs as well  and right here john says that the new  mini is going to be getting the a14 chip  which makes total sense because the ipad  air 4 currently has the a14  and originally i thought that it  wouldn't make sense at all for the mini  to come  later this year because apple is going  to be revealing the new a15 ship  in the new iphone 13. so it would be  weird for the mini to get released  after that with the previous gen chip  but then i did a little bit of digging  and i found that every single ipad mini  except for the second generation model  in 2013  received a chip one generation older  than the iphone that was released that  same year  and the reason the 2013 ipad mini got  the same a7 chip as the iphone 5s  is probably because the a7 was the very  first  64-bit chip to be used in a smartphone  which was a very big deal for apple so  with that said  a14 on the ipad mini 6 makes total sense  and jon's sources say that it's going to  be coming by the end of this year  which also makes sense because in the  past most of the ipad minis were  revealed  in the fall and as far as the price tag  i personally think that it's going to be  starting at 499  simply because the fact that apple  raised the ipad air force price  by 100 bucks last year up to 599 dollars  and it was totally justified because of  the new redesign  at least from apple's perspective so  that ended up leaving a nice little gap  for the mini to also get a price jump up  to 499 bucks  and that means that the regular ipad 9  will also get bumped up to probably  around 399 dollars  when it eventually gets the full  redesign but based on all of these  details and renders  i have a pretty good feeling that the  ipad mini 6 is going to be  very popular even with a higher price  tag  and i think we can for sure expect it to  get released  between september and november so  hopefully you guys enjoyed this video  and if you did go ahead and click the  circle above to subscribe  definitely check out one of those two  videos right there thanks for watching  and we'll see you  in the next video

